# Mobile app API configuration
# Copy to .env and adjust for your environment.

# REQUIRED for physical device testing — use your PC's LAN IP (run `ipconfig`):
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.105:3000/api

# Optional port override (default 3000):
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_PORT=3000

# Production:
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://your-api.example.com/api

# Notes:
# - Admin dashboard uses Vite proxy → always hits localhost:3000 (works on PC only)
# - Mobile app must reach the API over LAN — localhost only works on emulator/simulator
# - AWS S3 is only for image storage; products/categories come from your local PostgreSQL via API
# - After changing .env, restart Expo: npx expo start -c
